146	/// with no trailing newline.
147	///
148	/// Every hint has the same three primitive fields, so the tabular form is the one TOON prescribes (§1.4): `tool` is
149	/// the tool name; `params` is the string holding the parameters' compact JSON object text, exactly the `params` object
150	/// of the JSON companions (`{}` when there are none); `reason` is the reason or `null` when absent. Each cell is
151	/// quoted per §7.2, so the JSON text is always quoted with its `"` escaped as `\"`, and a line break in any field is an
